# Numeric id of the folder the solution deployed into.
#
# `uip or folders list` shows the folder KEY (a GUID) but not the numeric id —
# read the id from
#   GET {baseUrl}/{org}/{tenant}/orchestrator_/odata/Folders
# and take the `Id` field of the folder named RestBackendSample.
#
# The two identifiers are not interchangeable: sending the GUID where the number
# belongs produces 403 errorCode 1017, which reads like a permissions problem
# rather than a wrong identifier.
#
# The deployed app does not need this — the platform injects the folder as
# <meta name="uipath:folder-key">. It is only for `npm run dev`.
VITE_UIPATH_FOLDER_ID=
